<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-us">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>UnifiedDB continuous deployment artifacts for @@GITHUB_REF_NAME@@</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.7/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" integrity="sha384-LN+7fdVzj6u52u30Kp6M/trliBMCMKTyK833zpbD+pXdCLuTusPj697FH4R/5mcr" crossorigin="anonymous">
  <body>
    <div class="container my-5">
      <div class="p-5 text-center bg-body-tertiary rounded-3">
        <img src="udb-block.svg" width="100" height="100"/>

        <h1 class="text-body-emphasis">UnifiedDB Deployment Artifacts</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          Produced from branch <strong>@@GITHUB_REF_NAME@@</strong>, commit <code>@@GITHUB_SHA@@</code>.
          <br/>
          Created on @@TODAY@@
        </p>
        <p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col">
          <h3>Resolved standard specification</h3>
          <p>
            The <em>resolved specification</em> is the database after applying the <code>$inherits</code> operator on data.
            The resolved specification is what should be used by downstream tools.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <a href="@@PAGES_URL@@/resolved_spec/index.yaml">index.yaml</a>
              Database index, as array of relative paths from @@PAGES_URL@@/resolved_spec
              <ul>
                <li>
                  For example, you can find Sm.yaml at <a href="@@PAGES_URL@@/resolved_spec/ext/Sm.yaml">@@PAGES_URL@@/resolved_spec/ext/Sm.yaml</a>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="@@PAGES_URL@@/resolved_spec/resolved_spec.tar.gz">resolved_spec.tar.gz</a>
              The contents of the resolved specification as a tarball
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row">
        <div class="col">
          <h3>UDB Documentation Site (Preview)</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="@@PAGES_URL@@/docs-preview/">Documentation site built with Docusaurus</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row">
        <div class="col">
          <h3>UDB Gem Documentation</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="@@PAGES_URL@@/htmls/udb_api_doc/index.html"><code>udb</code> Ruby API</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row">
        <div class="col">
          <h3>IDL Documentation</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="@@PAGES_URL@@/idl.html">IDL language documentation</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row">
        <div class="col">
          <h3>Repository development</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="@@PAGES_URL@@/reuse_bom.txt">Reuse Bill of Materials (LICENSE information)</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://dhower-qc.github.io/udb-stats/riscv/riscv-unified-db/latest-report/report.html">GitHub usage statistics (updated daily)</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row">
        <div class="col">
          <h3>JSON Schemas</h3>
          <p>
            JSON Schema files for validating riscv-unified-db data files.
            Each version is immutable once published.
          </p>
@@SCHEMA_INDEX_HTML@@        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.7/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js" integrity="sha384-ndDqU0Gzau9qJ1lfW4pNLlhNTkCfHzAVBReH9diLvGRem5+R9g2FzA8ZGN954O5Q" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
  </body>
